notes:
  kira:
    title: Kira Thornwood
    short: Reluctant hero with innate fire magic, former blacksmith's apprentice caught between rebels and crown. See [[Demo Notes#Fire magic|her training]].
    long: |
      # Kira Thornwood

      **Age:** 24
      **Role:** Protagonist, reluctant hero

      ## Background

      Former blacksmith's apprentice from the Northern village of Millhaven.
      She discovered her innate fire magic when raiders attacked her home.

      ## Arc

      She learns to control her powers while she moves between the rebels and
      the crown. Her choice decides whether the kingdom survives its fracture.
    tags:
      - '[[Demo Notes#Fire magic|Fire magic]]'
      - Protagonist
    membership:
      narrative: protagonists
      political: northern-rebels
      magic: innate-users
      influence: village
    placement:
      political:
        x: rebel
        'y': militant
    connections:
      narrative:
        - to: valdric
          label: hunted by
        - to: elena
          label: trained by
        - to: elena
          label: trusts
      magic:
        - to: temple-amulet
          label: seeks
    width: 260
  valdric:
    title: Lord Valdric
    short: Grand Inquisitor hunting magic users. See [[Demo Notes]] for the setting.
    long: |
      # Lord Valdric Ashmore

      **Age:** 52
      **Role:** Primary Antagonist

      Grand Inquisitor of the Crown. He believes that magic users are
      abominations that must be controlled or removed.
    tags:
      - Antagonist
    membership:
      narrative: antagonists
      political: inquisition
      magic: clerics
      influence: court
    connections:
      narrative:
        - to: marcus
          label: pursues
      political:
        - to: elena
          label: suspects
        - to: marcus
          label: watches
      influence:
        - to: marcus
          label: commands
  elena:
    title: Elena Brightwater
    short: Court mage secretly aiding the rebellion and mentoring Kira. Her lessons focus on restraint, trust, and [[Demo Notes#Fire magic|controlling fire magic]] before either side can turn Kira into a weapon.
    long: |
      # Elena Brightwater

      Court mage who secretly sympathizes with the rebellion.
      She teaches Kira to control her abilities.

      > "Power answers the hand that holds it steady."

      ## Duties

      - Advise the Royal Court.
      - Protect Kira from the Inquisition.
      - Keep her own loyalty hidden.
    tags:
      - '[[Demo Notes#Fire magic|Fire magic]]'
      - Mentor
    membership:
      narrative: supporting
      political: royal-court
      magic: scholars
      influence: court
    placement:
      political:
        x: crown
        'y': pragmatic
    connections:
      narrative:
        - to: valdric
          label: secretly opposes
      political:
        - to: kira
          label: aids
      magic:
        - to: kira
          label: teaches
      influence:
        - to: kira
          label: advises
  marcus:
    title: Marcus the Red
    short: A pragmatic rebel commander who sees Kira's power as the key to victory. He must balance the urgency of the uprising against the safety of villages caught between both armies. His plans put increasing pressure on Elena's secret work at court, while Kira questions whether winning at any cost will leave a kingdom worth saving. Read [the rebellion](Demo%20Notes.md#The%20rebellion) for background.
    long: |
      # Marcus the Red

      Leader of the Northern Rebellion. A pragmatic commander who sees Kira's
      power as the key to victory.

      ## Plans

      - Unite the northern houses.
      - Take the Ember Heart before the Crown does.
      - Keep the villages out of the crossfire.
    tags:
      - Rebel
    membership:
      narrative: supporting
      political: northern-rebels
      magic: null
      influence: rebellion
    placement:
      political:
        x: neutral
        'y': militant
    connections:
      narrative:
        - to: kira
          label: recruits
      political:
        - to: valdric
          label: null
      influence:
        - to: kira
          label: protects
    width: 600
  temple-amulet:
    title: The Ember Heart
    short: Ancient artifact that massively amplifies fire magic; sought by both factions. See [[Demo Notes#The Ember Heart|the amulet lore]].
    long: |
      # The Ember Heart

      Ancient artifact said to amplify fire magic tenfold.
      Both sides race to find it.
    tags:
      - '[[Demo Notes#The Ember Heart]]'
    membership:
      narrative: null
      political: null
      magic: artificers
      influence: null
    connections:
      magic:
        - to: firestone
          label: amplifies
  firestone:
    title: Firestone Magic
    short: Emotion-driven fire magic where passion must be balanced against self-destruction. Read [the notes](Demo%20Notes.md) for details.
    long: |
      # Firestone Magic

      Magic flows from emotional intensity. Fire users must balance passion
      with control, or they risk self-immolation.
    tags:
      - Magic
    membership:
      narrative: null
      political: null
      magic: innate-users
      influence: null
    connections:
      magic:
        - to: firestone
          label: reinforces
    width: 120
  millhaven:
    title: Millhaven
    short: A northern village at the edge of the rebellion. See [[Demo Notes|the notes]] and [[Demo Notes#The rebellion]].
    long: |
      # Millhaven

      A small northern village of smiths and farmers. It sits on the road
      between the rebel camps and the Crown's patrols.
    membership:
      influence: village
    connections:
      narrative:
        - to: kira
          label: home of
